{"file": "满朝文武都以为我败家-第127集.mp4", "ep": 127, "duration": 65.0, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 1.61, "text": "大哥"}, {"start": 1.61, "end": 2.61, "text": "怎么了"}, {"start": 4.83, "end": 7.78, "text": "程勇"}, {"start": 7.78, "end": 9.88, "text": "大哥想请你帮个忙"}, {"start": 10.88, "end": 11.88, "text": "大哥只管说"}, {"start": 11.88, "end": 13.88, "text": "果然是我的好弟弟"}, {"start": 13.88, "end": 14.88, "text": "那是"}, {"start": 14.88, "end": 15.88, "text": "好弟弟"}, {"start": 15.88, "end": 16.88, "text": "你帮大哥顶几天"}, {"start": 16.88, "end": 17.88, "text": "五成兵马斯的班"}, {"start": 17.88, "end": 18.88, "text": "大哥忙完就去换你"}, {"start": 19.88, "end": 21.88, "text": "这 这不好吧"}, {"start": 21.88, "end": 22.88, "text": "没什么不好的"}, {"start": 22.88, "end": 23.88, "text": "有你爹在呢"}, {"start": 23.88, "end": 24.88, "text": "谁敢动你"}, {"start": 25.88, "end": 26.88, "text": "你帮大哥这一回"}, {"start": 26.88, "end": 27.88, "text": "下次大哥挣钱"}, {"start": 27.88, "end": 28.88, "text": "还带你"}, {"start": 28.88, "end": 33.02, "text": "大哥"}, {"start": 33.02, "end": 34.02, "text": "你去哪儿"}, {"start": 34.02, "end": 35.02, "text": "沟郎听曲"}, {"start": 35.02, "end": 36.02, "text": "叉花弄玉"}, {"start": 36.02, "end": 37.02, "text": "张龙召火"}, {"start": 37.02, "end": 38.02, "text": "走"}, {"start": 38.02, "end": 39.02, "text": "闻相隔"}, {"start": 46.67, "end": 47.67, "text": "今晚还不打叉尾吗"}, {"start": 47.67, "end": 48.67, "text": "不了"}, {"start": 48.67, "end": 50.8, "text": "公子说了会帮我熟身"}, {"start": 50.8, "end": 51.8, "text": "我再去抛头露面"}, {"start": 51.8, "end": 53.8, "text": "便是不是抬举了"}, {"start": 53.8, "end": 54.86, "text": "姑娘"}, {"start": 54.86, "end": 55.86, "text": "方公子上次来"}, {"start": 55.86, "end": 56.86, "text": "没提带你走之事"}, {"start": 56.86, "end": 57.86, "text": "许久没来"}, {"start": 59.76, "end": 60.76, "text": "我姓公子"}, {"start": 60.76, "end": 61.76, "text": "他不来我便等着"}, {"start": 62.92, "end": 63.92, "text": "姑娘"}, {"start": 63.92, "end": 64.92, "text": "你这又是何苦"}]}